# No trailing slash: a trailing slash restricts the pattern to DIRECTORIES,
# and git treats a symlink as a file. A `node_modules -> ../acsc-main/node_modules`
# symlink (the way parallel worktrees share one install) therefore slipped past
# `node_modules/` and was committed to main, so every fresh clone got a dangling
# link. Keep these bare.
node_modules
dist
